{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-98-1","title":"Psalms 98:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The psalmist exhorts the Jews, 4 the Gentiles, 7 and all the creatures, to praise God.</p>\n<p>Sing. 33:3; 96:1; 149:1; Isa 42:10; Re 5:9; 14:3 for he. 77:14; 86:10; 105:5; 136:4; 139:14; Ex 15:6,11; Isa 43:18-20 Jer 31:22; Lu 1:49; 2:10-14; Ac 2:11; Re 15:3,4 his right. 2:5,6; 45:3-5; 110:2-6; Ge 3:15; Ex 15:6; Isa 52:10; 59:16; 63:5 Joh 16:33; Ac 19:20; Col 2:15; Heb 2:14,15; Re 3:21; 6:2; 17:14 Re 19:11-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-2","title":"Psalms 98:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>made. Isa 45:21-23; 49:6; 52:10; Mt 28:19; Mr 16:15; Lu 2:30-32; 3:6 Ro 10:18; Tit 2:13 righteousness. 22:31; 24:5; Isa 45:24,25; 46:13; 62:2; Jer 23:6; Joh 16:8-10 Ro 3:21-26; 9:30; 10:3,4; 2Co 5:21; Php 3:9; 2Pe 1:1 openly shewed. or, revealed. Ro 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-3","title":"Psalms 98:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>remembered. 106:45; Le 26:42; De 4:31; Mic 7:20; Lu 1:54,55,72; Ro 15:8,9 all the ends. 2; 22:27; 67:7; Isa 45:22; 49:6; 52:10; Lu 2:30,31; 3:6; Ac 13:47 Ac 28:28; Ro 10:12,18; Re 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-4","title":"Psalms 98:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>47:1-5; 66:1,4; 67:4; 95:1; 100:1; Isa 12:6; 42:11; 44:23; Jer 33:11 Zep 3:14; Mt 21:9; Re 19:1,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-5","title":"Psalms 98:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>33:2; 92:3,4; 1Ch 15:16; 25:1-6; 2Ch 29:25; Re 5:8; 14:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-6","title":"Psalms 98:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>trumpets. 47:5; 81:2-4; Nu 10:1-10; 1Ch 15:28; 2Ch 5:12,13; 29:27 the king. 47:6,7; Mt 25:34; Re 19:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-7","title":"Psalms 98:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Let. 96:11-99:9 world. 97:1; Isa 49:13; 61:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-8","title":"Psalms 98:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Let the floods. 47:1; 2Ki 11:12; Isa 55:12 hills. 65:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-98-9","title":"Psalms 98:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":98,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":98,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>for he cometh. 96:10,13; Re 1:7 with righteousness. 67:4; 72:2; Isa 5:16; Ac 17:31; 24:25; Ro 2:5,6</p>"}]}